written('rnn','p1','code','修正cell；現在每次都丟掉previous state：\ndef forward(self, x_t, h_prev):\n    return torch.tanh(self.Wx(x_t))','def forward(self, x_t, h_prev):\n    return torch.tanh(self.Wx(x_t) + self.Wh(h_prev))',['加上recurrent項','先加後tanh','Wx與Wh結果要同hidden size'],'Wx給當前輸入；Wh給舊記憶。')
